# <%= current_page.data.title %>

The file transfer service receives files through SFTP or FTPS, checks them for
malware and delivers clean files to the configured destination.

## [Service guidance](operations/index.html)

Investigate file transfers, replay failed messages and troubleshoot AWS
Transfer Family users.

## [User guidance](user-guide/index.html)

Request an SFTP or FTPS user and understand how the service processes files.

## [Supported patterns](supported-patterns/index.html)

Choose a standard way to send or collect files using the service.

## Get help

Post in `#ask-integration-hub` with the username, environment, file name and
upload time. Do not share passwords, private keys or file contents.